"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, BL2 Mod Manager will be installed into the game's core folder (sdk_mods folder and DLLs inside Binaries\\Win32). Required mod files 'BouncyLootGod.sdkmod' and 'coroutines.sdkmod' will be installed inside the sdk_mods directory.",
