"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"Borderlands 2 is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When 'borderlands2.apworld' is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to 'Options Creator' to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, a new 'Mods' button should appear in the main menu, (re)open the Archipelago Launcher, launch the 'Borderlands 2 Client' and connect to the client. Finally, you can go back to the game, go to the 'Mods' section from the main menu and enable the 'BouncyLootGod' mod. After doing so you see a message saying that you are connected, you can now create a new save and start playing!",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Revert Infos",
"kill",
"You have 2 revert options, both can't be enabled at the same time.\n\nIf you use the 'Clear AP Mods' option it will only delete the mods that are required for BL2 Archipelago.\n\nIf you use the 'Full Clear' option it will delete everything related to the BL2 Mod Manager and mods. If other mods are detected an additional confirmation will appear.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] PopTracker Infos",
"kill",
"Some games have a PopTracker integration for Archipelago which allows you to track all possible Locations, Items, Upgrades, Zones, Hints and more depending on the game.\n\nFor the setup there are 3 different cases:\n\n\t• If the selected directory does not contain a PopTracker folder (or any similarly named folder), a new 'poptracker' folder will be created and the pack will be downloaded to poptracker\\packs.\n\n\t• If the selected directory already contains a folder with 'PopTracker' in its name, the installer will look for a poptracker.exe file. If one is found, the pack will be downloaded to its packs folder. If no poptracker.exe is found, the folder will be renamed to 'poptracker' and any missing files or folders will be created.\n\n\t• If the selected directory is already a PopTracker folder (for example: C:\\Users\\magni\\Documents\\poptracker), its contents will be validated. If everything is present, the pack will simply be downloaded to poptracker\\packs. Otherwise, the folder will be repaired before the pack is installed.",
